    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>Level 5 Bastion Facility</em></p><p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> None<br /><strong>Space:</strong> Roomy<br /><strong>Hirelings:</strong> 1<br /><strong>Order:</strong> Recruit</p><p>Sleeping quarters for up to twelve Bastion Defenders. A Bastion can have more than one Barrack.</p><p><strong>Recruit: Bastion Defenders.</strong> Each Recruit order brings up to four Bastion Defenders to your Bastion and lodges them in this Barrack, at no cost. You can't issue this order if the Barrack is full. Keep track of the defenders in each Barrack and remove those you lose; give them names and personalities as you like.</p><p><strong>Enlarging the Facility.</strong> For 2,000 GP, your Barrack becomes Vast and can house up to twenty-five Bastion Defenders.</p>",
